            "text": "90°",
            "correct": false
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "q-media-multiple",
        "type": "multiple",
        "prompt": "Listen to the 440 Hz standard tuning chime above. Which of the following statements about this audio tone are true? / 试听上方播放的标准 440 Hz 音频，以下关于此音调的描述哪些是正确的？",
        "audio": {
          "id": "sample-media-aud-chime",
          "mimeType": "audio/wav",
          "name": "chime-440hz.wav",
          "size": 16044
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "opt-m-1",
            "text": "It corresponds to the standard concert pitch A4 (La). / 对应标准国际音乐会基准音 A4 (La)。",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "id": "opt-m-2",
            "text": "Its fundamental frequency is 440 vibrations per second. / 它的基频为每秒振动 440 次。",
            "correct": true
          },
          {
            "id": "opt-m-3",
            "text": "It is an infrasonic wave below human hearing threshold. / 它是低于人耳听觉阈值的次声波。",
            "correct": false
          },
          {
            "id": "opt-m-4",
            "text": "It is a supersonic wave above 20 kHz. / 它是高于 20 kHz 的超声波。",
            "correct": false
          }
        ]
      },
      {
